  "question": {
    "text": "What is the amount of CaCl<sub>2</sub> in grams (i = 2.47) dissolved in 2.5 L of water such that its osmotic pressure is 0.75 atm at 27<sup>o</sup>C.?<br />\rReport your answer up to one decimal place."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3.4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to van't Hoff equation<br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>Osmotic pressure</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>π</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>i CRT</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>in</mtext> <mtext>B</mtext> </msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br />i = 2.47; V = 2.5 L; R = 0.0821 L atm K<sup>-1</sup> mol<sup>-1</sup><br />T = 27 + 273 = 300 K; π = 0.75 atm<br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>n</mtext> <mtext>B</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>π</mtext> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>iRT</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>0.75 atm</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>2.5 L</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>2.47</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>0.0821 L atm K</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <msup> <mtext>mol</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>300 K</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>0.0308 mol</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />Amount of CaCl<sub>2</sub> dissolved = n<sub>B</sub> × M<sub>B</sub><br />= (0.0308 mol) × (111 g mol<sup>-1</sup>)<br />= 3.42 g"
  }
